data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1203\">PCI Express Gen2 x8 interface</strong>, this NIC ensures optimized throughput for virtualization, cloud computing, and heavy data workloads. The adapter is compatible with all major operating systems and server platforms, making it ideal for enterprise deployment.</p><p data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1429\"><br></p><h3 data-start=\"1436\" data-end=\"1459\"><strong data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1459\">Key Features:</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1980\"><li data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1496\">\n<p data-start=\"1462\" data-end=\"1496\"><strong data-start=\"1462\" data-end=\"1472\">Model:</strong> AOC-STG-i2T Rev. 2.01</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1497\" data-end=\"1527\">\n<p data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1527\"><strong data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1514\">Controller:</strong> Intel X540</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1565\">\n<p data-start=\"1530\" data-end=\"1565\"><strong data-start=\"1530\" data-end=\"1544\">Interface:</strong> PCI Express 2.1 x8</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1566\" data-end=\"1608\">\n<p data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1608\"><strong data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1578\">Ports:</strong> 2 x 10GBASE-T RJ45 (Copper)</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1653\">\n<p data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1653\"><strong data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1621\">Speed:</strong> 10 Gbps per port, full duplex</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1654\" data-end=\"1694\">\n<p data-start=\"1656\" data-end=\"1694\"><strong data-start=\"1656\" data-end=\"1668\">Cabling:</strong> Cat6a/Cat7 (up to 100m)</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1695\" data-end=\"1858\">\n<p data-start=\"1697\" data-end=\"1721\"><strong data-start=\"1697\" data-end=\"1719\">Advanced Features:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1858\"><li data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1747\">\n<p data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1747\">Jumbo Frame Support</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1750\" data-end=\"1766\">\n<p data-start=\"1752\" data-end=\"1766\">VLAN Tagging</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1769\" data-end=\"1794\">\n<p data-start=\"1771\" data-end=\"1794\">TCP/UDP/IP Offloading</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1797\" data-end=\"1811\">\n<p data-start=\"1799\" data-end=\"1811\">iSCSI Boot</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1814\" data-end=\"1858\">\n<p data-start=\"1816\" data-end=\"1858\">IEEE 802.3az (Energy Efficient Ethernet)</p>\n</li></ul>\n</li><li data-start=\"1859\" data-end=\"1925\">\n<p data-start=\"1861\" data-end=\"1925\"><strong data-start=\"1861\" data-end=\"1877\">Form Factor:</strong> Low-profile and full-height brackets included</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1926\" data-end=\"1980\">\n<p data-start=\"1928\" data-end=\"1980\"><strong data-start=\"1928\" data-end=\"1946\">Compatibility:</strong> Windows, Linux, VMware, FreeBSD</p></li></ul><h3 data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2009\"><strong data-start=\"1993\" data-end=\"2007\">Ideal For:</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"2010\" data-end=\"2194\"><li data-start=\"2010\" data-end=\"2038\">\n<p data-start=\"2012\" data-end=\"2038\">Enterprise &amp; SMB Servers</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"2039\" data-end=\"2094\">\n<p data-start=\"2041\" data-end=\"2094\">Virtualization Platforms (VMware, Hyper-V, Proxmox)</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"2095\" data-end=\"2125\">\n<p data-start=\"2097\" data-end=\"2125\">Storage and Backup Systems</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"2126\" data-end=\"2153\">\n<p data-start=\"2128\" data-end=\"2153\">High-Speed LAN Upgrades</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"2154\" data-end=\"2194\">\n<p data-start=\"2156\" data-end=\"2194\">Cloud and Data Center Infrastructure</p></li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"Mellanox CX4121A-ACAT CX4 10G/25G SFP28 Ethernet Network Card","href":"/mellanox-cx4121a-acat-cx4-10g25g-sfp28-ethernet-network-card","now":"18,000৳","old":"20,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Silicom 4x 10GE Quad Port PCI Ex